            "type": "text",
            "text": " throw is 90 x 100 cm. The modified half treble routes the first pull-through the back loop of the stitch below, creating a dense, slightly diagonal surface that is firmer than regular htr."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The stitch looks similar to woven fabric when worked in a solid aran. It is slightly tighter than regular htr, so the same hook size gives a narrower gauge. Total yardage is around 700 g."
          }
        ]
      },
