        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "How to work herringbone htr"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Yarn over. Insert hook into stitch. Pull up a loop (3 loops on hook). Pull this new loop through the first loop on the hook (2 loops remain). Yarn over and pull through both remaining loops. One hhtr made."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
